description	"Rune Haako 

A Cowardly Officer who needs assistance to even the odds.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% Slower RoF
-- 50% Less Damage
- Rune's Self Defense Pistol
-- Based on DC Carbine (3)
-- 190% Slower RoF
-- Small Mag
-- Mag Reload
-- Applies Tracking
- Stun Baton (1)
- Sonic Detonators (2)
- Concussion Grenade (2)
- Cyro Grenade (2)

^5Powers:
- Call to Arms (Force Energize 3)
- Wealth Protects (Absorb 1)

^6Inventory:
- Seeker Drone ^3[CS3]
- Defense Drone ^3[CS4]
- Call Droid Reinforcement ^3[CS2]
- Sentry Gun ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Rally 
- Tradefed Commlink (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Interfacing Skills (+50% Hack Speed)
- Paranoid (Anti MT 1)
- Cowardice (15%+ Move Speed In Melee)
- Droid Bodyguard (Round Spawner B1 Battle Droid)

^3Abilities:
- Armor/Resource/Block Dispenser (3) ^3['Use' on allies]
-- +1 Range"